  "clean_text": "Best Eye Hospital in Bangalore | For All Eye Problems Best Eye Hospital in Bangalore | For All Eye Problems About Services Social Impact Donate Pledge Your Eyes Education Careers Our Blog Contact Services About Us About Pledge Your Eyes Contact Education Social Impact Services Donate Awards Dr.RVR Awards and Biography lasikblr Sankara Lasik Services OUR STORY SERVICES SOCIAL IMPACT From Patient Testimonies, to World Class Eye Care Visioned towards building a sustainable eye care model across the country, Sankara was started with the mission to work towards eradicating needless blindness. Sankara Eye Foundation India, a not-for-profit entity founded by Dr. R.V. Ramani and Dr. Radha Ramani in 1977, is dedicated to delivering high-quality eye care services to underserved communities. What began as a modest primary health care center has blossomed into a formidable social enterprise. Presently, Sankara stands as a beacon of hope, managing a network of 14 cutting-edge super specialty eye care hospitals strategically positioned across Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Karnataka, Gujarat, Punjab, Uttar Pradesh, Madhya Pradesh, Rajasthan, Maharashtra, and Telangana. Learn More Services and Information Choose Hospital Anand Bangalore Coimbatore RS Puram Coimbatore Sathy Road Guntur Jaipur Kanpur Krishnankoil Ludhiana Shimoga Indore Panvel Hyderabad Varanasi Clinical Services Outpatient Working hours Monday – Saturday 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM Sundays ( Emergency Services) Emergency Contact 02692-280450/60 Speciality Services Cataract Cornea Glaucoma Orbit & Oculoplasty Paediatric Ophthalmology Uvea Service Vision Enhancement & Rehabilitation Services Vitreoretinal Services Neuro Vision Rehabilitation Ocularistry clinic Low Vision Clinic Our Team of Doctors Dr. Nisha Ahuja – MBBS, DOMS, FCRS (Chief Medical Officer, Cataract, Cornea and Refractive Surgery) Dr. Ridhi Upadhyay- MBBS, DNB (Paediatric Ophthalmology & Strabismus Neuro-ophthalmology) Dr. Hitendrasinh Parmar – MB